vFM Player - OPL3 MIDI banks

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/OPL3

Copy the supplied BNK/BNK.GZ files. Used by the OPL3_4 MIDI profile and the OPL3 section of midi.ini.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/OPL3

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
